---
source: crates/daemon/tests/cli_help.rs
expression: stdout
---
Score or rewrite text using the deterministic humanizer gate

Usage: mxr humanize [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  score    Score arbitrary text
  rewrite  Rewrite arbitrary text using the LLM rewrite pass
  help     Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --format <FORMAT>  [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help             Print help
